{"session_id":"f4a72df9-5dd6-4e2e-8b37-470046177ca8","transcript_path":"/Users/ryan/.claude/projects/-Users-ryan-Documents-agent-marketing/f4a72df9-5dd6-4e2e-8b37-470046177ca8.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/ryan/Documents/agent_marketing","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/ryan/Documents/agent_marketing/.claude/commands/README.md","old_string":"4. **Complex Feature Development**\n   ```bash\n   /build-feature \"payments\"         # Scaffold feature\n   /add-tool \"payment_processor\"     # Add AI tool if needed\n   /test-feature \"payment_workflow\"  # Test the feature\n   /finishing-feature-work           # Final checks\n   ```","new_string":"4. **Building a New Feature (Recommended)**\n   ```bash\n   /complete-feature \"payments\"      # One command that does it all:\n                                     # - Scaffolds feature\n                                     # - Adds tools (if needed)\n                                     # - Runs UX review (mandatory)\n                                     # - Writes tests (mandatory)\n                                     # - Full checks\n                                     # - Creates PR\n   ```"},"tool_response":{"filePath":"/Users/ryan/Documents/agent_marketing/.claude/commands/README.md","oldString":"4. **Complex Feature Development**\n   ```bash\n   /build-feature \"payments\"         # Scaffold feature\n   /add-tool \"payment_processor\"     # Add AI tool if needed\n   /test-feature \"payment_workflow\"  # Test the feature\n   /finishing-feature-work           # Final checks\n   ```","newString":"4. **Building a New Feature (Recommended)**\n   ```bash\n   /complete-feature \"payments\"      # One command that does it all:\n                                     # - Scaffolds feature\n                                     # - Adds tools (if needed)\n                                     # - Runs UX review (mandatory)\n                                     # - Writes tests (mandatory)\n                                     # - Full checks\n                                     # - Creates PR\n   ```","originalFile":"# Claude Code Commands\n\nQuick access commands that chain multiple skills together for common workflows.\n\n## Available Commands\n\n### Environment & Health\n\n#### `/check-deployment`\nComprehensive health checks for all environments (dev, staging, production).\n\n**When to use:**\n- Verifying local development setup is healthy\n- Debugging connection issues (Docker, database, Redis)\n- Checking deployed application status\n- Pre-work validation\n- Investigating issues\n\n**What it checks:**\n- Docker containers and services\n- Database connectivity and integrity\n- Redis availability\n- Environment variables\n- Gem dependencies\n- Asset compilation status\n- Application uptime and performance\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/check-deployment\n# Prompts to select environment (dev/staging/prod)\n```\n\n#### `/prepare-dev-env`\nComplete setup of development environment from scratch.\n\n**When to use:**\n- **Fresh developer onboarding** (first time setup)\n- **New machine** (moving to different computer)\n- **Major dependency updates** (Ruby/gem changes)\n- **Recovering from corruption** (services broken)\n- **Complete reset** (starting fresh)\n\n**Don't use if:** You just want to verify your current setup. Use `/check-deployment` instead.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Validates system requirements\n- Configures environment variables\n- Starts Docker services\n- Creates and migrates database\n- Installs gems and compiles assets\n- Seeds sample data\n- Verifies all components\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/prepare-dev-env\n```\n\n---\n\n### Code Quality & Commits\n\n#### `/quick-commit [message]`\nFast pre-commit workflow for small changes.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Runs quick tests (changed files only)\n- Fixes RuboCop offenses\n- Commits with message\n- Ready to push\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/quick-commit \"Fix validation bug\"\n```\n\n**Uses skills:** running-tests (quick), fixing-rubocop-offenses, making-quick-commits\n\n#### `/finishing-feature-work`\nFull pre-commit workflow before creating PR.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Runs full test suite\n- Fixes all RuboCop offenses\n- Cleans up merged branches\n- Updates documentation\n- Optional auto-commit\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n# Run all checks\nUse finishing-feature-work\n\n# Skip docs update during development\nUse finishing-feature-work with skip_docs=true\n\n# Auto-commit if all passes\nUse finishing-feature-work with auto_commit=true\n```\n\n**Uses skills:** running-tests, fixing-rubocop-offenses, cleaning-up-git-branches, updating-documentation\n\n---\n\n### Testing\n\n#### `/test-feature [workflow_name]`\nComprehensive feature testing workflow.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Tests all Scout AI tools\n- Tests specific workflow (if provided)\n- Runs full test suite\n- Generates summary report\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/test-feature create_campaign\n```\n\n**Uses skills:** testing-tools-manually, testing-workflows-manually, running-tests\n\n---\n\n### Feature Development\n\n#### `/complete-feature [feature_name]` ⭐ (Recommended)\nEnd-to-end feature development with mandatory UX review and testing.\n\n**What it does:**\n1. Scaffolds the feature (model, controller, routes)\n2. Creates Scout AI tools (if needed)\n3. Creates V2 workflow templates (if needed)\n4. **Runs UX review on all new views**\n5. **Writes comprehensive system tests**\n6. Full pre-commit checks (linting, tests, docs)\n7. Creates draft PR on GitHub\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/complete-feature \"subscription management\"\n```\n\n**Use this for:** Building any new feature where you want quality built-in\n\n---\n\n#### `/build-feature [feature_name]`\nScaffold new feature with proper patterns (component only).\n\n**What it does:**\n- Creates model with entity scoping\n- Generates migration\n- Creates controller with authentication\n- Adds routes\n- Generates tests\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/build-feature \"subscription\"\n```\n\n**Use this for:** When you want just the Rails scaffold without full workflow\n\n#### `/add-tool [tool_name]`\nCreate new Scout AI tool.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Generates tool file from template\n- Adds to tool catalog\n- Creates test file\n- Shows usage examples\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/add-tool \"send_sms\"\n```\n\n**Uses skills:** starting-features\n\n#### `/add-workflow [workflow_name]`\nCreate new V2 workflow template.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Generates YAML template\n- Sets up three-phase structure\n- Adds keywords\n- Creates test script\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/add-workflow \"create_landing_page\"\n```\n\n**Uses skills:** starting-features\n\n#### `/add-integration [service_name]`\nAdd new external integration.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Creates Integration record\n- Generates IntegrationOperation definitions\n- Adds authentication handling\n- Creates test suite\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\n/add-integration \"Stripe\"\n```\n\n**Uses skills:** starting-features\n\n---\n\n## Command vs Skill\n\n**Commands** = Quick shortcuts that chain multiple skills\n**Skills** = Individual reusable capabilities\n\n### When to use Commands:\n- Common workflows you repeat often\n- Multi-step processes\n- Onboarding new developers\n- Pre-commit checks\n\n### When to use Skills directly:\n- Single-purpose tasks\n- Custom parameters needed\n- Learning the system\n- Building custom workflows\n\n## Creating Custom Commands\n\nCommands are just markdown files in `.claude/commands/`:\n\n```markdown\n# My Custom Command\n\nDescription of what it does.\n\n## Usage\n\n\\`\\`\\`\n/my-custom-command [args]\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Implementation\n\n\\`\\`\\`bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Chain skills together\n.claude/skills/skill-one/scripts/script.sh\n.claude/skills/skill-two/scripts/script.sh\n\\`\\`\\`\n```\n\nThen use with: `/my-custom-command`\n\n## Command Cheatsheet\n\n| Task | Command | Speed | Thoroughness |\n|------|---------|-------|--------------|\n| **Build complete feature** | **`/complete-feature`** | **Medium** | **Complete** |\n| Setup dev environment | `/prepare-dev-env` | Slow | Complete |\n| Check system health | `/check-deployment` | Fast | Medium |\n| Quick fix commit | `/quick-commit \"fix\"` | Fast | Basic |\n| Pre-PR checks | `/finishing-feature-work` | Medium | Complete |\n| Build scaffold only | `/build-feature` | Fast | Scaffold |\n| Test specific feature | `/test-feature` | Slow | Complete |\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Development Setup (First Time)**\n   ```bash\n   /prepare-dev-env          # Full setup from scratch\n   /check-deployment         # Verify everything is working\n   ```\n\n2. **During Development**\n   ```bash\n   /check-deployment         # Quick health check before starting work\n   /quick-commit \"fix bug\"   # Fast commit for changes\n   ```\n\n3. **Before Creating PR**\n   ```bash\n   /finishing-feature-work   # Full pre-commit checks\n   /github-push \"Feature\"    # Push and create draft PR\n   ```\n\n4. **Complex Feature Development**\n   ```bash\n   /build-feature \"payments\"         # Scaffold feature\n   /add-tool \"payment_processor\"     # Add AI tool if needed\n   /test-feature \"payment_workflow\"  # Test the feature\n   /finishing-feature-work           # Final checks\n   ```\n\n5. **Troubleshooting**\n   ```bash\n   /check-deployment         # See what's broken\n   /reset-database          # Hard reset if corrupted\n   /prepare-dev-env         # Complete environment reset\n   ```\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Skills Usage Guide](../.claude/docs/skills-usage-guide.md)\n- [Compound Skills Guide](../.claude/docs/compound-skills-guide.md)\n- [Individual Skills](../.claude/skills/)\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":289,"oldLines":12,"newStart":289,"newLines":15,"lines":["    /github-push \"Feature\"    # Push and create draft PR","    ```"," ","-4. **Complex Feature Development**","+4. **Building a New Feature (Recommended)**","    ```bash","-   /build-feature \"payments\"         # Scaffold feature","-   /add-tool \"payment_processor\"     # Add AI tool if needed","-   /test-feature \"payment_workflow\"  # Test the feature","-   /finishing-feature-work           # Final checks","+   /complete-feature \"payments\"      # One command that does it all:","+                                     # - Scaffolds feature","+                                     # - Adds tools (if needed)","+                                     # - Runs UX review (mandatory)","+                                     # - Writes tests (mandatory)","+                                     # - Full checks","+                                     # - Creates PR","    ```"," "," 5. **Troubleshooting**"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
